{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"pest","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Pest and PEG","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pest and PEG (.pest .peg .pegjs .peggy).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"pest","name":"Pest and PEG","extensions":[".pest",".peg",".pegjs",".peggy"],"grammar":"grammars/pest.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Pest and PEG","path":"snippets/pest.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/pest.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*(?=\\\\s*=)\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[~|*+?!&]|=>|\\\\.\\\\.\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[_@$](?=\\\\s*\\\\{)|(?<==\\\\s)[_@$!](?=\\\\s*\\\\{)\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'[^']*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:ASCII_ALPHANUMERIC|ASCII_HEX_DIGIT|ASCII_DIGIT|ASCII_ALPHA|WHITESPACE|NEWLINE|COMMENT|PUSH|PEEK|SOI|EOI|ANY|POP)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/pest.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Rule\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rule\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} = { ${2:ASCII_ALPHA+} }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A rule\"\n  },\n  \"Silent rule\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"srule\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} = _{ ${2:rule} }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A silent rule\"\n  },\n  \"Whitespace\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ws\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"WHITESPACE = _{ \\\" \\\" | \\\"\\\\\\\\t\\\" | NEWLINE }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Implicit whitespace\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Pest and PEG\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pest and PEG.\n\n## Files\n\n`.pest`, `.peg`, `.pegjs`, `.peggy`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rule` | A rule |\n| `srule` | A silent rule |\n| `ws` | Implicit whitespace |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}